    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Burume khu Yerusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamalile khurusiao sifunikho sia Yuda. Mu ndaalo eyo walola bulwaani bubwabiikhwa Munju eye Mumusiru, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "namwe nga ne mwabona muli Lukoba lwa Daudi, lwatechukhaka akali, mala mwabuusila kameechi mu litiisi lie mwaalo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwabala bibioneekhe mu chinju cha Yerusalemu mala mwatechulaka chinju chindala khu lumia lisiisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwabuumba enjikha eye kameechi akari we kamasiisi kabili khulwe kameechi ke Litiisi Likhale, ne kakhali se mwalola khu Wele owa likhola tawe, namwe semwenaana khu walirekekha khale akho tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Engaani khu Shebuna",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwami WELE we banamae aloma ali, “yiicha oche khu mwimeelesi khu Shebuna, ooli omuliindi we lichipi mala olome oli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "olikho okhola ano siina? Ne naanu niye oli naye ano, nio wechoongeele eng'ani wamwene ano, wachoonga eng'ani yowo angaaki ne khukhwichoongela limenya mu lwanda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lola, Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi acha khukhurusiamo ne khukhumwaata ne kamaani, Ee ewe owe kamaani. Alakhutilila elala, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'ali alakhuuchilisia mala akhumwaate nga kumupiira, mu sibala sie aleeyi, olifwiila ebweeneyo, ne kamakaari ke lukoosi lwowo ke liie kaliba ebweneeyo, ewe waambia chisoni enju eyo mwami wowo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lundi Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi alakhurusia mu bwimeelesi mala akhwikhisie khukhwama abwikhalo bwowo bwe angaaki.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aboolela Shebuna ali, “Nga kamenako ne kalikholekha ndilanga omukholi wase Eliakimu okhwa Hilikia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndimufwara ekutuusi yowo eye kimilimo, muboe kumusiipi mala muelesie bunyali bwoosi nibwo ewe wabelenge nabwo. Alaba nga raraawe owe babaandu ba Yerusalemu ne Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.3.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lif. 3.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ndamuela elala bunyali buli asi wo mwami, owe lisaaye lia Daudi. Aliba ne bufunguo bwenju eye kimilimo, niyo ekuule salibao omundu olikala ta, ne niyo ekale salibao omundu olikula tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndimulumia taatatata, abuundu ao, aandalale nga sichaangi, mala alaba niye sinoko sie lukoosi lwenju yabwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ne balebe bewe boosi ne bamenywa bewe baliba busiro khu niye balimubwamakho nga chinyuungu ne bibuumba khu sichaangi! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga kamenako ne kalikholekha sichaangi sisiasimikhwa siaandalala silitekeya mala sikwe. Ne kano kalaba sisiakamo sia buli sisiindu sisiaba ne sietiila khu sichaangi” Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi alomile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
